    "name":  "Enemy Markers",
    "slug":  "enemy-markers",
    "teaser":  "Simply a Marker that shows the enemies with a \"v\" shaped marker. Can also display the distance from the enemy.",
    "thumbnail":  "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2509.png",
    "downloads":  18707,
    "favourites_count":  17,
    "description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI (APerson) AM NOT THE ORIGINAL CREATOR OF THIS MOD\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis mod gives you the ability to spot an enemy and have a Marker showing where they are for \u003cstrong\u003e5 Seconds\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers/-/raw/master/resources/scav.png?ref_type=heads\u0026amp;inline=false\" alt=\"scav scoped\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConfigurable:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMarker character\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSize\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDistance / Radius from center\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eColor by “player” category (Bear/Usec/Scav/Boss …)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo install just unzip at the root of your SPT folder and it will create a \u003ccode\u003eBepInEx\\\\plugins\\\\flir.enemymarkers\u003c/code\u003e directory for you\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eIf you want to help in the development of this mod you are welcome to propose merge requests or issues on its project page: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ehttps://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo not make requests somewhere else than gitlab as I would not see them, I (flir) am not the “author” of this mod, just an additional author.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecial Thx to Level-Yellow-316 on Reddit for originally making this mod.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKnown Issues\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003enone ATM\u003c/p\u003e\n",
